# Screenshot capture output (npm run shots). Working material: the keepers get
# uploaded into Sanity, so the local copies don't need to ship.
#
# Except fullpage.webp. Those are the screens seated into the project cards,
# served straight from public/ rather than through Sanity, so ignoring them
# shipped a site whose every card pointed at a 404 -- which looked perfect
# locally, because locally the files are right there. Note the trailing /*:
# ignoring the DIRECTORY would stop git descending into it and the negation
# below would never be consulted.
public/assets/projects/*/shots/*
!public/assets/projects/*/shots/fullpage.webp

# Chrome profile holding signed-in sessions for `npm run shots`. Never commit:
# it contains live auth cookies for the apps being captured.
.shots-profile/

# Local contact sheet for reviewing poster captures. Never deployed: it lists
# client screens (BTI) that have no business on a public portfolio.
/public/_shots.html
